Flat buffer - one malloc, one free, index by hand:
```
char *grid = malloc(rows * cols);
grid[y * cols + x] = '.';
```

Direction vectors keep traversal flat:
```
int dx[4] = {1, -1, 0, 0};
int dy[4] = {0, 0, 1, -1};

int k = 0;
while (k < 4)
{
    int nx = x + dx[k];
    int ny = y + dy[k];
    if (nx >= 0 && nx < cols && ny >= 0 && ny < rows)
        visit(grid, nx, ny);
    k++;
}
```
